<title>CHINA: Trading in Kingboard shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Trading in Kingboard shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Kingboard Chemical Holdings Ltd was suspended on Monday afternoon at the company's request pending an announcement, the Hong Kong stock exchange said.  </p>
<p>Shares of the laminates manufacturer were up HK$0.80 or 30.77 percent to HK$3.40 at midday. Volume was 14.32 million shares worth HK$46.41 million.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
